<title>SINGAPORE: Saudi Aramco tenders to sell July 98-RON reformate.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco tenders to sell July 98-RON reformate.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Saudi Aramco is offering by tender 32,000 to 35,000 tonnes of 98-octane unleaded reformate for July 26-28 lifting from Jubail on the Red Sea, industry sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on July 8, they said.</p>
<p>Traders said the export cargo was Aramco's &quot;usual quarterly tender&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
